\ref{item:dissineq2}$\Rightarrow$\ref{item:dissineq3}: This follows by a~continuity argument.\\
\ref{item:dissineq3}$\Rightarrow$\ref{item:dissineq4}: 
Consider the mapping
\begin{align*}
    \mathcal{T}:\qquad \mathcal{W}&\to{\mathbb{R}},\\
    \left(\begin{smallmatrix}x\\u\end{smallmatrix}\right)&\mapsto 2\operatorname{Re}\scprod*{\widetilde{P}x}{A\&B \left(\begin{smallmatrix}x\\u\end{smallmatrix}\right)}_{\mathcal{V} 
